<title>INDIA: Indian gold ends lower after higher start.</title>
<headline>Indian gold ends lower after higher start.</headline>
<dateline>BOMBAY 1996-10-04</dateline>
<text>
<p>Gold prices closed lower on Friday after a higher start met with resistance, dealers said.</p>
<p>Prices of gold biscuit (116.50 gramme) dropped 50 rupees to 59,750 per piece after rising 100 rupees on Thursday.</p>
<p>Silver prices drifted lower on higher arrivals of imported metal and sluggish industrial demand, the dealers said.  </p>
<p>		  TODAY'S CLOSING (BOMBAY)	  PVS CLOSING</p>
